1
00:00:00,204 --> 00:00:04,624
"Normally, I'm not turned on by big teeth,
but on you they work."

2
00:00:05,543 --> 00:00:08,543
I got a whole list of them.
Who wants to be my wingman?

3
00:00:08,712 --> 00:00:12,212
You're not gonna need a wingman.
You're gonna need a paramedic.

4
00:00:13,092 --> 00:00:15,632
(Penny(entering):)Howard, your scooter's blocking my car.

5
00:00:15,803 --> 00:00:18,303
Oh, did you get pink eye again?

6
00:00:20,182 --> 00:00:22,522
Step one: she notices the eye patch.

7
00:00:23,894 --> 00:00:27,234
(Howard:)May I say, Penny, not a lot of women
could look as hot as you do...

8
00:00:27,398 --> 00:00:29,988
(Howard:)...with such greasy hair.

9
00:00:37,074 --> 00:00:41,374
(Penny:)Yeah, just move your stupid scooter before
I pick it up and throw it in the dumpster.

10
00:00:42,329 --> 00:00:43,579
[DOOR SLAMS]

11
00:00:44,832 --> 00:00:47,022
(Sheldon:)Ow.

